WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
The result. The assistant answers with aircraft cards backed by application data.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:09.239
Expose a handler. The app registers its aircraft query as a tool with Hashbrown.

00:00:09.239 --> 00:00:20.008
Run the request. The scripted model calls the app tools; the actual handlers run in the browser.

00:00:20.008 --> 00:00:24.308
Connect code to capability. The highlighted source connects aircraft queries to the registered tool.

00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:29.708
Inspect the result. The generated UI displays data from the tool response.
